:: MP NPC Ash More2 Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
雨后第二天，林子里到处是滴水声。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>把湿靴倒挂在棚架上，蹲在火塘边削一根灯芯木，木屑攒成一小撮才拨进火里。北岭那边露出一道干白，他说午后起风前还能做完几样零碎活：前坡的灯绳、松明与油布归在一处，溪道倒木与灯簿归在另一处，北岭岩台、河湾渡口和雾季守夜则另夹在远行页里。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回营地 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[先翻前坡琐事 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[先看溪畔整备页 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[查远行与雾季守夜 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Date More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Daily More Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
火塘边的石台上摊着前坡急着要办的三样活计。棚梁上的旧灯绳<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyAsh10>>今天已经换上新搓的椴皮绳<<else>>断口发黑，正等着用泡软的椴树皮重搓<</if>>；北坡雷劈松下的松明<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyAsh11>>已经捡回棚里晾着<<else>>再不去收就会被山雨泡软<</if>>；柴垛顶上的油布<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyAsh12>>已经用熟桐油补过<<else>>磨薄了一角，夜风一扯便会漏雨<</if>>。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>把小刀收回腰袋，让你挑一件顺手的先动。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总目 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[先搓一盘灯绳 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Daily 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<mpsmokeicon>><<link [[先上北坡捡松明 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Daily 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<mpsewicon>><<link [[先修补柴垛顶油布 (0:05)|MP NPC Ash Daily 12]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Daily More2 Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
石台另一侧压着溪畔与入夜后的两桩收尾活。去溪边取水的近道上<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyAsh13>>倒木已经清到坡下，水路畅通<<else>>横着一棵被风刮倒的白桦，树冠卡在冬青丛里挡死了去路<</if>>；油布灯簿的最后几页<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyAsh14>>已经用炭笔誊清并画齐记号<<else>>还是零散的炭笔速记，水汽一重就会洇成一团<</if>>。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>拨亮火塘，说这两桩活急不得，得沉下气做。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回更多目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[清开溪道倒木 (0:05)|MP NPC Ash Daily 13]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[誊清灯簿末页记号 (0:05)|MP NPC Ash Daily 14]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Date More Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<set _ashFestYear to (_npc.festivalYear or 0)>>
<<set _ashYearNow to (Time.date.year or 0)>>
灯簿后半册夹着两处远门与雾季守夜的折页。北岭岩台<<if $daily.mpNpcDateAsh5>>今日已经上去看过云海<<else>>要在破晓前登顶才看得见云海翻涌<</if>>，河湾渡口<<if $daily.mpNpcDateAsh6>>今晚已经拉过渡索<<else>>要等天擦黑平流时才好拉索过河<</if>>。至于每逢秋深才开的封桥守灯夜，<<if _ashFestYear is _ashYearNow>>今年的守夜灯簿已经合上<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">>眼下正是备料守夜的时节<<elseif Time.season is "winter">>秋雾已散，只剩桥头余烬<<else>>还得等秋雾压境才会启封<</if>>。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总目 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去北岭岩台 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Date 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[前往河湾渡口 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Date 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<if (_npc.hasMet or 0) and Time.season is "autumn" and _ashFestYear isnot _ashYearNow>>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[翻看雾季守夜灯簿 (0:05)|MP NPC Ash Festival Prep]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<elseif _ashFestYear is _ashYearNow>>
今年灯簿已收，来年秋深再启。
<<elseif not (_npc.hasMet or 0)>>
守夜的灯簿压在箱底，还不便翻给你看。
<<else>>
雾季还远，灯簿收在箱底。
<</if>>
:: MP NPC Ash Daily 10 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
雾还没散尽，溪边泡软的椴树皮已经被<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>拎回火塘旁，撕成指头宽的细条码在膝头。旧灯绳是被林间潮气从芯里沤断的，新绳得用三股树皮并拢，掌心压稳一头再往膝上慢搓，每搓一下退半寸让纤维自己咬紧。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyAsh10>>新搓好的灯绳已经牢牢系在棚梁灯钩上，火光再没有晃动。<<else>>他把压绳头的青石往你手边推了推，等你挑一头上手。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回前坡琐事 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[学他搓紧灯绳 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Daily 10 After]]>><<pass 8>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActAsh10 to 1>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 240>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh10 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh10 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[先帮他按稳旧绳头 (0:07)|MP NPC Ash Daily 10 After]]>><<pass 7>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActAsh10 to 2>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 220 or ($willpower or 0) gte 220>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh10 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh10 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Daily 11 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
午后云底抬高，北坡那棵雷劈老松在陡石坎上露出焦黑的断茬。松脂全凝在背风一侧的树根与断枝里，劈开带着沉甸甸的松香，是最耐潮的引火料。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>背着粗布袋站在坡下，先看风向再看松针。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyAsh11>>粗布袋已经装满透亮的松明，搁在棚檐下阴干。<<else>>上坎的路满是滑腻的湿松针，一人上去劈凿，另一人得在崖下接应。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回前坡琐事 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpsmokeicon>><<link [[跟进松林劈料 (0:09)|MP NPC Ash Daily 11 After]]>><<pass 9>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActAsh11 to 1>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 230 or ($tending or 0) gte 230>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh11 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh11 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[先守在石坎下接应 (0:10)|MP NPC Ash Daily 11 After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActAsh11 to 2>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 220 or ($willpower or 0) gte 220>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh11 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh11 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Daily 12 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
柴垛顶上的油布被风磨薄了一角，透光能看见细碎的针眼。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>把油布平摊在两截树桩之间，四角压上沉石，又端出温在火塘边的熟桐油与粗麻线。补油布得先把裂口缝紧，再顺着纹路刷两层热油封住针眼。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyAsh12>>补好的油布已经重新盖回柴垛，四角用麻绳拴得严严实实。<<else>>北岭的云走得极快，入夜起风前必须把破角封死。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回前坡琐事 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[帮他拉平油布 (0:09)|MP NPC Ash Daily 12 After]]>><<pass 9>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActAsh12 to 1>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220 or ($athletics or 0) gte 220>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh12 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh12 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpsewicon>><<link [[动手缝合破损边角 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Daily 12 After]]>><<pass 8>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActAsh12 to 2>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh12 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh12 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Daily 13 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
溪边取水的近道上横着一棵被夜风刮倒的白桦，树冠死死卡在对岸的冬青丛里，整根树干绷着一股暗劲。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>绕着倒木看了两圈，掌心贴在树皮上试了试受力方向：直接硬抬会弹伤手腕，得先把卡死的侧枝砍断卸力，再顺着斜坡滚进土沟。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyAsh13>>倒木已经稳稳滚入坡下浅沟，取水的小径重新露了出来。<<else>>他抽出腰间小斧，问你先动哪一头。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回溪畔整备 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[合抬树干重头 (0:12)|MP NPC Ash Daily 13 After]]>><<pass 12>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActAsh13 to 1>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh13 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh13 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[动手砍断卡死侧枝 (0:10)|MP NPC Ash Daily 13 After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActAsh13 to 2>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 220 or ($willpower or 0) gte 220>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh13 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh13 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Daily 14 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
入夜后营地只剩火塘边一圈暖光。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>翻开油布灯簿的最后几页，上面用炭笔画着飞鸟、层云与犬爪的简记，边缘已经被夜雾洇得有些发虚。他磨尖一截干炭条，要把这几天的风向、断绳位置和水位刻度一笔笔誊进正册。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyAsh14>>散记已经全数誊进正页，油布封皮也重新系紧了麻绳。<<else>>他把旧页推到你手边，让你帮着对一遍记号。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回溪畔整备 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[逐行念旧散记 (0:10)|MP NPC Ash Daily 14 After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActAsh14 to 1>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 240>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh14 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh14 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[替他描清炭笔图标 (0:09)|MP NPC Ash Daily 14 After]]>><<pass 9>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActAsh14 to 2>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 220 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh14 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh14 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Daily 10 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<set _act to ($daily.mpNpcDailyActAsh10 or 1)>>
<<set _ok to ($daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh10 or 0)>>
灯绳搓到收尾，阿什举到火光前，细细看纤维有没起毛。
<<if _act is 2>>
<<if _ok>>你按住旧绳头，他顺着你的手劲接上断口，麻纤维硌得掌心发热；收尾时他让你亲手打结，说这灯算你半个手艺。<<else>>你按偏半寸，旧绳头一滑弹开，纤维扎进指腹；阿什接过绳头重新理齐，让你在旁看一遍手法，灯钩今晚仍空着。<</if>>
<<else>>
<<if _ok>>你学他退指压掌的节奏，三股椴皮咬成一股匀实绳芯；他捏住绳尾轻拽，点头把新绳挂上灯钩，火光稳得没有晃。<<else>>你抢快半拍，绳股中途松口，只能拆开重搓；阿什不催，把压绳青石推回你手边，让你先练顺掌心力道。<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyAsh10>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDailyAsh10 to 1>>
<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
<<if _ok>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回日常页 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一件事 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Daily 11 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<set _act to ($daily.mpNpcDailyActAsh11 or 1)>>
<<set _ok to ($daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh11 or 0)>>
松明劈口渗着清亮松脂，阿什蹲下捻了一撮凑近闻。
<<if _act is 2>>
<<if _ok>>你在坎下铺旧油布接住松明，又用长杆拨开松动碎石；一袋料安然落地，他下来时拍了拍你肩头的松针。<<else>>碎石忽落，你扶杆的手被带得一晃，半袋松明砸在坎底；阿什下来先看你有没有伤，再把可用的几块挑回袋里。<</if>>
<<else>>
<<if _ok>>你扶稳断枝，他顺纹理下斧，松明一块块落进布袋；回程他让你背最沉那捆，说这段陡坎往后你也能独行。<<else>>你下斧偏半指，劈开的松明带着长刺，扎得虎口发麻；他接过斧头修齐断口，让你把碎屑拢进背篓，改日再学。<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyAsh11>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDailyAsh11 to 1>>
<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
<<if _ok>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回日常页 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一件事 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Daily 12 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<set _act to ($daily.mpNpcDailyActAsh12 or 1)>>
<<set _ok to ($daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh12 or 0)>>
油布摊在两截树桩之间，针眼在光下透出细碎亮点，阿什把麻线穿进骨针。
<<if _act is 2>>
<<if _ok>>你照旧针脚走线，转角收针一压，麻线服帖地咬住裂口；他刷完第二层油，翻过边角说比他的手还齐。<<else>>你走得急，针距忽密忽疏，麻线在裂口尽头打了个死结；他剪掉那段重来，让你先在一块废布上练直行。<</if>>
<<else>>
<<if _ok>>你踩住一角把油布绷得像鼓面，他顺势刷下第一层热桐油；针眼封得严丝合缝，收工时他让你摸摸那声脆响。<<else>>风掀起布角，你脚下的油布滑开半幅，热油淋出一道歪痕；阿什压住四角重铺，说这面只能改做苫柴底布。<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyAsh12>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDailyAsh12 to 1>>
<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
<<if _ok>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回日常页 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一件事 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Daily 13 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<set _act to ($daily.mpNpcDailyActAsh13 or 1)>>
<<set _ok to ($daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh13 or 0)>>
倒木横在溪道正中，阿什把掌心贴上树皮试了试受力方向。
<<if _act is 2>>
<<if _ok>>你看准卡住冬青的侧枝下斧，三下便卸掉别劲，树干顺势滚下浅沟；他捡起断枝捆好，说留着正好给营地引火。<<else>>斧刃砍进湿节疤拔不出，你用力一别，刃口崩了个小豁；阿什递来磨石让你磨平，倒木只好等明日再搬。<</if>>
<<else>>
<<if _ok>>你和他各扛一头，顺坡势喊号起肩，树干稳稳滑进土沟；他拍掉你袖口木屑，说明早取水能少绕半里。<<else>>树根暗劲忽松，你肩头一沉，被树干带得踉跄；阿什拽住你腰带稳住，自己手腕磕在石棱上，倒木仍旧卡着。<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyAsh13>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDailyAsh13 to 1>>
<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
<<if _ok>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回日常页 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一件事 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Daily 14 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<set _act to ($daily.mpNpcDailyActAsh14 or 1)>>
<<set _ok to ($daily.mpNpcDailyOkAsh14 or 0)>>
灯簿翻到最后几页，炭笔字被夜雾洇虚，阿什削尖干炭条。
<<if _act is 2>>
<<if _ok>>你照他的笔意把犬爪与断绳描清，墨线细而不抖；他合上正册又打开看一遍，说这册往后能交给旁人认了。<<else>>你手肘碰翻茶盏，水渍漫过刚描好的图标；阿什用干布吸掉水汽，把洇花那页折角留作草稿，正册等明日重抄。<</if>>
<<else>>
<<if _ok>>你逐行念出飞鸟与层云的记号，他对照正册补上日期风向；念到犬爪那栏他笑了，说只有你和猎犬看得懂。<<else>>你把两处风向念反，他誊到一半停笔，用炭条轻轻划掉，让你重新对一遍鸟群飞向；这一页到底没能誊完。<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyAsh14>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDailyAsh14 to 1>>
<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
<<if _ok>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回日常页 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一件事 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Date 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
天还没亮透，<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>在棚外轻敲两下木柱。北岭的云从谷底漫上来，贴着树梢缓缓翻涌，顶上却是一片澄净的暗蓝。他把手里的小风灯往下压了压，免得晃花你的眼，说穿过矮松带和碎石坡就能赶在日出前登上北岭岩台。<<if $daily.mpNpcDateAsh5>>你们今天已经上过岩台，靴底还粘着高处的干松针。<<else>>山道湿滑，动身前可以先看清绳扣的位置。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回远行目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mphearticon>><<link [[跟他同登岩台 (0:16)|MP NPC Ash Date 5 Choice]]>><<pass 16>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[先问清碎石坡绳扣 (0:06)|MP NPC Ash Date 5 Choice]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Date 5 Choice [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
登上北岭岩台时，东天刚裂开一线灰白。脚下的云海像刚弹过的厚棉絮，远处的峰尖一座座浮在白雾之上。山风冷硬，<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>卸下背囊，在背风的岩壁凹槽里铺开粗毡，又指了指岩台边缘的风向标与石窝里的干柴，问你想怎么消磨破晓前这一刻钟。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回坡下 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Date 5]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[并肩坐等日出 (0:18)|MP NPC Ash Date 5 After]]>><<pass 18>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateAsh5 to ($daily.mpNpcDateAsh5 ? "wait2" : "wait1")>><</link>><br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[沿岩台巡看山脊 (0:20)|MP NPC Ash Date 5 After]]>><<pass 20>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateAsh5 to ($daily.mpNpcDateAsh5 ? "rim2" : "rim1")>><</link>><br>
<<mpsmokeicon>><<link [[拢起松枝生火煮茶 (0:17)|MP NPC Ash Date 5 After]]>><<pass 17>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateAsh5 to ($daily.mpNpcDateAsh5 ? "fire2" : "fire1")>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Date 5 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<set _raw to ($daily.mpNpcDateAsh5 or "wait1")>>
<<set _first to _raw.endsWith("1")>>
<<set _mode to _raw.slice(0, -1)>>
<<if _mode is "wait">>
你们背靠岩壁坐在粗毡上，<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>递来温热的松针水。晨光刺破云层时，云海染成浅金，他指给你看哪道山梁通向旧港。
<<if _first>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><</if>><<stress -5>>
<<elseif _mode is "rim">>
你随他沿着岩台外沿走了一圈，把松动的风向标石块重新垒稳。晨风把他的衣角吹得猎猎作响，他在最险的转角伸手护住你的手腕，直到山脊全线亮起。
<<if _first>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><</if>><<stress -4>>
<<else>>
你在石窝里拢起松枝煮开一壶苦香松茶，他捧着铁杯多说了几句早年守山的事，下山时替你背走了柴袋。
<<if _first>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><</if>><<stress -6>>
<</if>>
松针上的雨珠顺着树皮滑落，火塘里的余烬在山风里一明一暗。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回远行目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[随他缓步下北岭 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash More2 Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Date 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
天擦黑时，<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>带你拐下林外的缓水河湾。一条平底木船横在岸边，船头系着粗麻渡索，木桩上的旧铜铃挂着薄霜。摆渡老人入夜不在，过河得自己拉渡索。<<if $daily.mpNpcDateAsh6>>今晚你们已经渡过一回河，船板的湿痕还没干。<<else>>水面上正一层层漫起夜雾，上船前得先看清对岸老柳下的灯影。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回远行目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mphearticon>><<link [[跟他踏上渡船 (0:15)|MP NPC Ash Date 6 Choice]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[先查渡索吃水深浅 (0:05)|MP NPC Ash Date 6 Choice]]>><<pass 5>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Date 6 Choice [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
平底船滑到河心时，两岸轮廓都融进了乳白的水雾里。对岸老柳下的引路灯只剩一团模糊的暖黄，河水贴着船底发出细碎的轻响。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>站在船头稳稳换着渡索，回头问你要不要接手试一段，还是先顾好船舱与岸灯。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回渡口 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Date 6]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprowicon>><<link [[并肩拉索过河 (0:18)|MP NPC Ash Date 6 After]]>><<pass 18>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateAsh6 to ($daily.mpNpcDateAsh6 ? "rope2" : "rope1")>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[用麻絮塞紧船缝 (0:16)|MP NPC Ash Date 6 After]]>><<pass 16>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateAsh6 to ($daily.mpNpcDateAsh6 ? "seam2" : "seam1")>><</link>><br>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[举高船头风灯引路 (0:17)|MP NPC Ash Date 6 After]]>><<pass 17>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateAsh6 to ($daily.mpNpcDateAsh6 ? "lamp2" : "lamp1")>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Date 6 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<set _raw to ($daily.mpNpcDateAsh6 or "rope1")>>
<<set _first to _raw.endsWith("1")>>
<<set _mode to _raw.slice(0, -1)>>
<<if _mode is "rope">>
你摘下手套与他一前一后收放渡索，掌心很快磨热。船头顶上对岸浅滩时，他替你拂去虎口麻屑，夸你节拍极稳。
<<if _first>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><</if>><<stress -5>>
<<elseif _mode is "seam">>
你半跪在舱底用桐油麻絮把渗水的木缝一道道压实，船身顿时轻快了半寸。靠岸拴好缆绳后，他递来干净布巾让你擦手，眼里带着温和的赞许。
<<if _first>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><</if>><<stress -5>>
<<else>>
你举高防风灯照亮水下暗桩与渡索。靠岸后你们把老柳下的引路灯添满松油，回程水面映出长长的暖影。
<<if _first>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><</if>><<stress -6>>
<</if>>
松针上的雨珠顺着树皮滑落，火塘里的余烬在山风里一明一暗。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回远行目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[沿河湾小径返营 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash More2 Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Festival Prep [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
雾季前第七天，<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>带你走了一遍封桥灯道。第七盏灯最远，桥洞夜风往上猛灌，油一少火光就压不住浓雾。<<if (_npc.axis or 0) gte 35>>他把封桥主灯交到你手里，说今年这一盏由你定。<<elseif (_npc.axis or 0) gte 15>>他分给你半袋干苔，让你挑一样拿手的先备齐。<<else>>他只让你在近处打下手，先把灯料备足一格。<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[去备节前物料 (0:10)|MP NPC Ash Festival]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.festivalPrep to "ready">><<set $mpNpcs.ash.festivalPrepYear to (Time.date.year or 0)>><<stress -2>><</link>>
:: MP NPC Ash Festival [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
雾季守夜当天，天黑得比平日早了半个时辰。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>把七只铜灯罩一字排在石台上，现有的火种只够稳稳点亮六盏。封桥那盏顶着峡谷风口，必须有人守着添油；界石外的岔路也常有夜行人迷途。他把三样差事摊开，等你落定今夜去向。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[独守封桥主灯 (0:14)|MP NPC Ash Festival Resolve]]>><<pass 14>><<tiredness 3>><<set _npc.festivalChoice to "lamp">><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[巡查界石外岔路 (0:16)|MP NPC Ash Festival Resolve]]>><<pass 16>><<tiredness 4>><<set _npc.festivalChoice to "patrol">><</link>><br>
<<mphearticon>><<link [[守在火塘旁陪他坐 (0:10)|MP NPC Ash Festival Resolve]]>><<pass 10>><<tiredness 2>><<set _npc.festivalChoice to "company">><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Festival Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<set _yearNow to (Time.date.year or 0)>>
<<set _first to ((_npc.festivalYear or 0) isnot _yearNow)>>
<<set _ch to (_npc.festivalChoice or "lamp")>>
<<set _prep to (((_npc.festivalPrepYear or 0) is _yearNow and (_npc.festivalPrep or "none") is "ready") ? "ready" : "none")>>
<<set _ax to (_npc.axis or 0)>>
<<if _ch is "lamp">><<set _stat to Math.max(($willpower or 0), ($tending or 0))>>
<<elseif _ch is "patrol">><<set _stat to Math.max(($athletics or 0), ($willpower or 0))>>
<<else>><<set _stat to Math.max(($willpower or 0), ($tending or 0)) + ((_npc.trust or 0) * 4)>><</if>>
<<set _stat += (_prep isnot "none" ? 40 : 0) + (_ax * 2)>>
<<set _res to (_stat gte 300 ? "full" : _stat gte 220 ? "part" : "fail")>>
浓雾从谷底翻涌上来时，<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>把防风灯塞进你手里，只嘱咐了一句灯在人在。你<<if _ch is "lamp">>守着封桥风口<<elseif _ch is "patrol">>巡着界石岔路<<else>>陪在火塘旁<</if>>，一刻不敢走神。<<if _res is "full">>你们撑过最冷的后半夜，七盏路灯一路亮到破晓，连界石外迷路的樵夫也平安循光归营。<<if _first>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, _ax + 6)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<stress -4>><<set _npc.festivalYear to _yearNow>><</if>><<set _lamps to 7>><<elseif _res is "part">>峡谷夜风吹灭了外围两盏副灯，好在封桥主灯稳稳撑到了天明。<<if _first>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, _ax + 3)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><<set _npc.festivalYear to _yearNow>><</if>><<set _lamps to 5>><<else>>湿雾压灭了大半灯芯，最后只有火塘与桥头三盏残灯熬到天亮，没能拿到半分贴补。<<if _first>><<set _npc.axis to Math.max(0, _ax - 3)>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<set _npc.festivalYear to _yearNow>><</if>><<set _lamps to 3>><</if>><<set _npc.festivalResult to _res>><<set _npc.festivalLamps to _lamps>>
松针上的雨珠顺着树皮滑落，火塘里的余烬在山风里一明一暗。<br><br>
<<getouticon>>
<<if _res is "fail">>
<<link [[收拢湿灯罩 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Festival Missed]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[独看冷透的灯罩 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Festival Missed]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link [[收灯返回棚屋 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Festival After]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[陪他逐盏清点余火 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Festival After]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Ash Festival After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<set _res to (_npc.festivalResult or "part")>>
雾季守夜过后，林间营地重新安静下来。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>把铜灯罩一只只擦净码进木箱，火塘边特意留出了你的干石座。<<if _res is "full">>他在灯簿末页工工整整添上一笔「七灯俱明，今夜有伴」，说明年雾起时还由你掌首灯。<<elseif _res is "part">>他在灯簿上圈出受潮熄灭的两处灯位，说明年提前半月备足松脂就能补齐。<<else>>他默默合上只打了三个勾的灯簿，将最干的一层松柴挪到火塘边，嘱咐你雾大时别独自走远。<</if>>木箱里码着的铜灯罩，他一只只数过，正好 <<print (_npc.festivalLamps or 0)>> 只。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回远行目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[陪他修剪备用灯芯 (0:06)|MP NPC Ash More2 Hub]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Festival Missed [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<set _npc.festivalResult to "missed">><<set _npc.festivalLamps to 3>>
雾季守夜收场时，天色比平日亮得晚。次日清早林间还挂着白霜，七盏路灯只亮了 <<print (_npc.festivalLamps or 3)>> 盏。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>独自在封桥守到天明，靴筒湿透，手背也被溅起的灯油烫出一道红痕。他把灭掉的灯罩收回木箱，没有多说什么，只低声说今年的秋雾比往年更沉。
<br><br>
